   .... Check that <<Type_alpha, `typeIR~a~` and `typeIR~b~` are the same type>>, for each `typeIR~a~` in `typeIR~a~^{asterisk}^` and `typeIR~b~` in `typeIR~b~^{asterisk}^`.
   .... The relation holds.
  ... If `$is_nominal_typeIR(typeIR~a_spec~) /\ $is_nominal_typeIR(typeIR~b_spec~)`:
   .... The relation holds.
