relation RoutineType_alpha: `routineTypeIR` and `routineTypeIR'`

. If `routineTypeIR` has type `functionTypeIR`:
 .. Let `functionTypeIR` be `routineTypeIR`.
 .. If let `BUILTIN_FUNCTION ( parameterTypeIR~a~^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~ret_a~` be `functionTypeIR`:
