  ... Check that `$distinct_<id>(id^{asterisk}^)`.
  ... Check that `$nestable_headerUnion(typeIR)`, for each `typeIR` in `typeIR^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Check that <<Type_wf, `bound |- typeIR`>> holds, for each `typeIR` in `typeIR^{asterisk}^`.
  ... The relation holds.

. Else if `typeIR'''` has type `enumTypeIR`:
 .. Let `enumTypeIR` be `typeIR'''`.
 .. If let `ENUM _ { id^{asterisk}^ }` be `enumTypeIR`:
  ... Group enumTypeIR-non-serializable: `bound` and `ENUM _ { id }`

   .... Check that `$distinct_<id>(id^{asterisk}^)`.
   .... The relation holds.

 .. Else if let `ENUM _ # typeIR { id = _ ;^{asterisk}^ }` be `enumTypeIR`:
  ... Group enumTypeIR-serializable: `bound` and `ENUM _ # typeIR { id = _ ; }`

   .... Check that `$distinct_<id>(id^{asterisk}^)`.
