--
+
for each `typeParameter` in `typeParameter^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Let `TC~1~` be `$add_types(LOCAL, TC~0~, tid~expl~^{asterisk}^, TID tid~expl~^{asterisk}^)`.
  ... Let `typeIR~ret~` and `tid^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<Type_ok, typing `typeOrVoid`, under cursor `LOCAL` and typing context `TC~1~`>>.
  ... Check that `tid^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `[]`.
