  ... Let `TC~2~` be `$add_types(BLOCK, TC~1~, tid~expl~^{asterisk}^, TID tid~expl~^{asterisk}^)`.
  ... Let `constructorParameter^{asterisk}^` be `$flatten_parameterList(parameterList)`.
  ... <<ConstructorParameters_ok, `BLOCK TC~2~ |- constructorParameter^{asterisk}^ : constructorParameterIR^{asterisk}^ # tid~impl~^{asterisk}^`>>.
  ... Let `constructorParameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^` be the list of `constructorParameterTypeIR`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
      * Let `constructorParameterTypeIR` be `$constructorParameterIR(constructorParameterIR)`
--
+
for each `constructorParameterIR` in `constructorParameterIR^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Let `nameIR` be `$name(name)`.
  ... Let `_^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_`, `_^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_`, `_^?^^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_^?^`, and `typeIR~package_inner~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR~package_inner~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
      * Let `_ typeIR~package_inner~ _ _^?^` be `constructorParameterTypeIR`
--
+
for each `constructorParameterTypeIR` in `constructorParameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Let `typeIR~package~` be `PACKAGE < typeIR~package_inner~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... Let `polyTypeDefIR~package~` be `typeIR~package~ < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... Check that <<TypeDef_wf, `$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~) |- polyTypeDefIR~package~`>> holds.
  ... Let `TC~3~` be `$add_type(GLOBAL, TC~0~, nameIR, polyTypeDefIR~package~)`.
  ... Let `cid` be `$cid(name, ( parameterList ))`.
  ... Let `typeIR~package_spec~` be `polyTypeDefIR~package~ < TID tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ ++ TID tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... Let `constructorTypeIR` be `CONSTRUCTOR ( constructorParameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~package_spec~`.
  ... Let `constructorTypeDefIR` be `constructorTypeIR < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... Check that <<ConstructorTypeDef_wf, `$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~) |- constructorTypeDefIR`>> holds.
  ... Let `TC~4~` be `$add_constructor(TC~3~, cid, constructorTypeDefIR)`.
  ... Let `packageTypeDeclarationIR` be `annotationList PACKAGE nameIR < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ > ( constructorParameterIR^{asterisk}^ ) ;`.
  ... Result in `TC~4~` and `packageTypeDeclarationIR`.

relation Decls_ok: `p`, `TC'`, and `declaration^{asterisk}^`

. If `declaration^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `[]`:
 .. Group nil: `p`, `TC`, and `[ ]`

  ... Result in `TC'` and `[ ]`.

. Else if let `declaration~h~ :: declaration~t~^{asterisk}^` be `declaration^{asterisk}^`:
 .. Group cons: `p`, `TC~0~`, and `declaration~h~ :: declaration~t~`

  ... Let `TC~1~` and `declarationIR~h~` be the result of <<Decl_ok, typing `declaration~h~`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC'`,
        * and the modified typing context>>.
  ... <<Decls_ok, `p TC~1~ |- declaration~t~^{asterisk}^ : TC~2~ declarationIR~t~^{asterisk}^`>>.
  ... Result in `TC~2~` and `declarationIR~h~ :: declarationIR~t~^{asterisk}^`.

relation Program_ok: `p4program`

