 .. Let `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)^?^` be `$find_routine_overloaded(p, TC, prefixedNameIR, argumentIR''^{asterisk}^)`.
 .. Check that `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)^?^` matches pattern `(_)`.
 .. Let `?(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id~default~^{asterisk}^)` be `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)^?^`.
