    ..... Let `typeIR` be <<canon, the canonicalized form of `typeIR~base~`>>.
    ..... Check that `typeIR` has type `headerTypeIR`.
    ..... Let `HEADER _ { _^{asterisk}^ }` be `typeIR`.
    ..... Let `methodTypeIR` be `BUILTIN_METHOD ( [ ] ) -> BOOL`.
    ..... Result in `methodTypeIR`, `[ ]`, and `[ ]`.
   .... Group typedExpressionIR-nameIR-builtin-method-union-isValid: `p`, `TC`, `typedExpressionIR~base~ . nameIR`, `[ ]`, and `[ ]`

    ..... Check that `nameIR` is in `["isValid"]`.
    ..... Let `typeIR~base~` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  `typedExpressionIR~base~`>>.
    ..... Let `typeIR` be <<canon, the canonicalized form of `typeIR~base~`>>.
    ..... Check that `typeIR` has type `headerUnionTypeIR`.
