  ... Else if let `[argumentIR]` be `argumentIR''^{asterisk}^`:
   .... Group typedExpressionIR-nameIR-builtin-method-stack-push-pop-front: `p`, `TC`, `typedExpressionIR~base~ . nameIR`, `[ ]`, and `[argumentIR]`

    ..... Check that `nameIR` is in `["push_front", "pop_front"]`.
    ..... Let `typeIR~base~` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  `typedExpressionIR~base~`>>.
    ..... Let `typeIR'` be <<canon, the canonicalized form of `typeIR~base~`>>.
    ..... Check that `typeIR'` has type `headerStackTypeIR`.
    ..... Let `typeIR [ _ ]` be `typeIR'`.
