  ... Let `(routineTypeIR, tid~impl~^{asterisk}^)` be `(routineTypeDefIR, tid*)`.
  ... Let `bound` be `$union_set<tid>($bound(p, TC), { tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ })`.
  ... Check that <<RoutineType_wf, `bound |- routineTypeIR`>> holds.
