relation Call_ok: `p`, `TC`, `routineTypeIR`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, `tid'^{asterisk}^`, `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `id~default'~^{asterisk}^`

. If `routineTypeIR` has type `functionTypeIR`:
 .. Let `functionTypeIR` be `routineTypeIR`.
