   .... Result in `typeIR~ret~`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^`.

 .. Else if let `FUNCTION ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~ret~` be `functionTypeIR`:
