   .... Let `parameterTypeIR~non_default~^{asterisk}^` be `$filter_default_parameters(parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^, id~default'~^{asterisk}^)`.
   .... Check that the length of `parameterTypeIR~non_default~^{asterisk}^` is equal to the length of `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Let `parameterTypeIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^` be `$align_parameters(parameterTypeIR~non_default~^{asterisk}^, argumentIR^{asterisk}^)`.
   .... Let `inference` be `$infer(tid'^{asterisk}^, parameterTypeIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^, argumentIR^{asterisk}^)`.
   .... Let `typeIR^?^^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR^?^`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
        * Let `typeIR^?^` be `$find_map<tid, typeIR>(inference, tid')`
--
+
for each `tid'` in `tid'^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Check that `typeIR^?^` matches pattern `(_)`, for each `typeIR^?^` in `typeIR^?^^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Let `typeIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR~inferred~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
        * Let `?typeIR~inferred~` be `typeIR^?^`
