relation Bind_constructor: `p`, `IC~0~`, `typeParameterListIR`, `methodPrototypeListIR`, and `methodPrototypeIR`

. Check that `methodPrototypeIR` matches pattern `%  % < , % > ( % ) ;`.
. Let `annotationList nameIR < , typeParameterListIR~inferred~ > ( parameterListIR ) ;` be `methodPrototypeIR`.
