  ... Check that `declarationIR'^?^` matches pattern `(_)`.
  ... Let `?declarationIR` be `declarationIR'^?^`.
  ... Check that `declarationIR` has type `constantDeclarationIR`.
  ... Let `constantDeclarationIR~inst~` be `declarationIR`.
