. Else if `parserStatementIR` has type `emptyStatementIR`:
 .. Let `emptyStatementIR` be `parserStatementIR`.
 .. Group emptyStatementIR: `IC~0~`, `STO~0~`, and `emptyStatementIR`

  ... Let `IC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `statementIR` be the result of <<Stmt_inst, the compile-time evaluation of `emptyStatementIR`, under cursor `LOCAL`, instantiation context `IC~0'~`, and store `STO~0~`>>.
