relation SwitchCase_inst: `p`, `instantiationContext`, `store`, and `switchCaseIR`

. Group : `p`, `instantiationContext`, `store`, and `switchCaseIR`

 .. If let `switchLabelIR : blockStatementIR` be `switchCaseIR`:
  ... Let `IC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `statementIR` be the result of <<Stmt_inst, the compile-time evaluation of `blockStatementIR`, under cursor `p`, instantiation context `instantiationContext`, and store `store`>>.
  ... Check that `statementIR` has type `blockStatementIR`.
  ... Let `blockStatementIR~inst~` be `statementIR`.
  ... Result in `IC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `switchLabelIR : blockStatementIR~inst~`.

 .. Else if let `switchLabelIR :` be `switchCaseIR`:
  ... Result in `instantiationContext`, `store`, and `switchLabelIR :`.

relation SwitchCases_inst: `p`, `IC'`, `STO'`, and `switchCaseIR^{asterisk}^`

. If `switchCaseIR^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `[]`:
 .. Group nil: `p`, `IC`, `STO`, and `[ ]`

