  ... <<SwitchCase_inst, `p IC' STO' |- switchCaseIR~h~ ==> IC~1~ STO~1~ switchCaseIR~h'~`>>.
  ... <<SwitchCases_inst, `p IC~1~ STO~1~ |- switchCaseIR~t~^{asterisk}^ ==> IC~2~ STO~2~ switchCaseIR~t'~^{asterisk}^`>>.
  ... Result in `IC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `switchCaseIR~h'~ :: switchCaseIR~t'~^{asterisk}^`.
